1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,680
Welcome to the Vibe Coding AI Agent Learning Platform.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:08,880
In traditional computer science education, students spent months memorizing complex

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:14,080
syntax line by line. This was akin to fixing horseshoes in the carriage era.

4
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,920
Today, AI agents represent a revolutionary paradigm shift,

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:22,320
similar to the transition from horse-drawn carriages to automobiles.

6
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:26,640
Business students no longer need to write every line of code manually.

7
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,920
Instead, you act as the driver and product manager,

8
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:34,880
steering system outcomes through high-level intent and architectural leadership,

9
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:40,800
to effectively drive an AI agent, business leaders master four-core engineering pillars.

10
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:45,840
First, prompt is your steering wheel defining persona and target deliverables.

11
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:52,000
Second, context is your interactive dashboard, providing working memory and long-term knowledge

12
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:56,560
based documents. Third, harness serves as your brakes and safety guardrails,

13
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:01,040
setting API tool boundaries and input sanitization filters.

14
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:06,240
Finally, loop acts as the engine heartbeat, triggering scheduled execution cycles and

15
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:11,440
self-correction quality checks. In Vibe Coding, you work with a three-role AI model.

16
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:17,680
The Butler role manages workspace infrastructure, file structures, and version control.

17
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:24,080
The coach role provides guidance on prompt security, context windows, and offers encouragement.

18
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:30,000
The engineer subagents perform parallel task execution such as data fetching and QA testing.

19
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,720
In Module 4, editing simple text files inside KB Theme config achieves true no-code maintenance

20
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:42,720
without breaking back-end logic. Inside the interactive lab, students can witness real-time

21
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:50,160
AI agent execution. When we launch the simulator, the agent reads KB Theme config, invokes subagents,

22
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:56,000
applies harness security filters to prevent prompt injection, and enforces copyright defense.

23
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,120
The output is a professional daily morning digest containing derived summaries and mandatory

24
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:07,360
source links delivered seamlessly. Finally, the platform displays a high-resolution vector blueprint

25
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:11,600
outlining the full system architecture. In the progress tracker section,

26
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:17,920
students and instructors can monitor study duration, interactive click counts, flashcard reviews,

27
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:23,360
and quiz scores. With a single click, you can export a bilingual CSV report.

28
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:29,520
The footer features the official signature by architect professor Shiman Lo, NCNU.

